Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hidden at the end of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NGol D. Rocks\NPepperjack\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the compass points, our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Pollychan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets, every tear that we've\Ncried only helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NNikki
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.39,0:01:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.20,0:02:03.50,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(979,1817)\t(937,979,\1a&H00&)\t(5442,5567,\1a&HFF&)}Fantasia
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.20,0:02:03.50,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(979,1817)}Fantasia
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listening, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.41,0:02:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fatayama Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.75,0:02:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh, duh, duh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.71,0:02:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bonehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievably beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound is amazing! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's come, as I always\Nknew it would. Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this was the ringing that Nolan heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Fourth is singing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is surely a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had almost abandoned hope\Nthat we would ever hear
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Golden Bell again after\Nnearly 400 years of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great warrior Kal 'gara, can you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The unmistakable echo\Nof the fire of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What must have happened to this land?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that strange chiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be the legendary bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mont Blanc, Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear the bell sounding\Nfrom beyond your grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May these chimes reverberate\Nall the way to your descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now rest in peace, Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like the bells ringing, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one bell in this\Nworld could echo so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with such emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.19,0:05:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know those giants you see\Nin the cumuloregalus clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story goes a little\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever a human inhabits the sky\Nand the sun's rays shine upon him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his shadow is reflected on the deep\Nmist and then cast far across the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To onlookers, the shadow appears as if\Nit's a gigantic monster looming above.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those aren't really giants?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.73,0:05:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're actually somebody's shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would mean we've\Nalready found irrefutable
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proof that people do live in\Nthe sky. Am I right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I once thought
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the story was a meaningless fantasy\Nand dismissed it altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.03,0:05:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems there is truth\Nto this legend my ears
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are filled with the resounding\Ncries of the golden bell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if a golden bell exists\Nthen why not an entire city
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,noland was telling the truth\Nhis reputation can finally be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,redeemed and with it our family\Nname that's the reason you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rang the bell, isn't it, kid?\NShrewd move. You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't forget this
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.47,0:06:28.05,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\c&H000000&\fscx32\fscy60\blur1\bord1\shad0\pos(1027.11,681.02)\3c&H000000&}MONKEY
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.47,0:06:28.05,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\c&H312A9F&\fscx32\fscy60\blur1.5\bord0\shad0\pos(1027.11,681.02)}MONKEY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cricket!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sick? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was...guess I was just so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.37,0:07:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's god shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Enel and his ship are...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bell's ringing ignites\Nthe fire of Shandora,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that long-gone city that took\Npride above all in its prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reverberations serve as the island's\Nsong, proclaiming the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:08:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a melody longing to be\Nheard by the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and generations of its natives\Nand supporters for 400 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although the journey of this restless\Nisland seemed nearly endless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time cannot fade even\Nits most distant memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For long ago, people entrusted their\Nwords in the sound of the golden bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lacing each ring with\Nwords of faith and hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which resounded across the distant sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey i wonder if pops heard it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah i'm sure he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bind the ropes to the\Nstrongest-looking trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Issie, were you scared, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise, your treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what? Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fine. Don't try to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you have to be treated right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wounds aren't that severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy, he needs more help than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body's worn out. He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he was trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:11:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make much sense, but he was\Ngoing all out just like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a hero? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, help him, raccoon. I'm\Na reindeer! Antlers, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're going to overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go rest with the blue sea people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to go and gather the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess anything's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, what do you\Nthink happened to Enel and the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they must have crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have a city of\Ngold, but in name only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which just means that our\Nadventure in poverty continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have dials over gold any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something we just\Ncan't get from the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm to the point where I'd\Nsettle for some concrete news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Nami's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's Conis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This not-knowing is driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's a good idea to leave\NWiper with the Blue Sea dwellers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears Aisa has befriended them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to act quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our enemy wakes before\Nwe leave, we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather those who can move and we'll banish
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every last one of Eneru's\Npriests to the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did you have a chance to patch him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he needs now is rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid I wouldn't\Nsee any of you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, she was worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you guys grabbed some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the pre-storage locker on\Nour way back through the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was lots more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, how did you manage\Nto find your way back down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Gum-Gum balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis, where's your old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.31,0:13:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.31,0:14:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were on the lower\Nlevel of the White Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found myself there after\Nbeing blasted from the ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wasn't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Countless others ended up in the same spot\Nwhile making their way towards Cloud End.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.15,0:14:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet as we speak, they too are now on the\Njourney back via the restored Milky Roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, given that there's\Nno longer an Angel Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a new destination was chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe you our lives, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just gone, Fong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I no longer go by that title.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were all forced to work in a\Nplace like this for six long years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost Angel Island, the home\Nwe were supposed to return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like the Shandians,\Nour birthright's now lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the battle really over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God's army is gone, but I just don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My chief, do you really believe the\N400-year rift can be mended so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I stuffed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's getting pretty late, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to hit the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're not talking\Nabout leaving, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, can you believe what she just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly. It's sick. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the thought doesn't even cross her\Nmind to go out and look for gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she calls herself a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you two like fat lips\Nto go with your fat bellies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time, and soon I will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the wide open sky, the\Nperfect home for a god,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pristine and unobstructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.67,0:16:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and best of all, no\Npests to get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure no one gets near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My own private paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A land boundless, exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.27,0:16:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like a dream\Nwhich comes to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maxim,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,set sail and deliver me to my new floating
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kingdom which shines\Nbrightly in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land without end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The endless birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside the ruins of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't move yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a Skypeian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest. Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, we are all bound together,\Nmade brothers by the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Golden Belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Shandorian's sacred\Nduty to protect it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.01,0:17:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, that's the sound of\Nwar drums announcing battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the signal fire, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patience, wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heroism of our ancestors is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whatever violence happened in the\Npast, you must allow it to stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our future starts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.05,0:17:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our home now, and we\NShandians will make it a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, most often the call for\Nvengeance cannot be ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today, it has been drowned out by a\Nsea of voices screaming in celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always hear your voice\Nwhile you wander far from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gazing up at the sky, you\Nare just like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never change as\Nyou climb into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection\Nwaves when you disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are, don't lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.03,0:19:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't ever look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams.\NThey're windless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They come to you again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not turn, I\Nhope that you'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind,\Nand just keep moving on.

